## 2. Technology Stack

### Backend
- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3.x
- Spring Web MVC
- Spring MVC SseEmitter for real-time updates
- Maven
- Jackson for JSON processing
- Spring Boot Actuator for health monitoring (if justified)

### Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Browser EventSource API for Server-Sent Events

### Persistence
- JSON-based file persistence for the initial implementation.
- Design a storage abstraction so H2, PostgreSQL or another database can be introduced later.

### Testing
- JUnit 5
- Mockito
- Spring Boot Test
- MockMvc

Avoid introducing unnecessary dependencies.

Do not use Node.js, Express, React, Angular, Socket.IO or frontend frameworks.

